{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 31, :comments ["<b>Lest you take your daughters from me.</b> For in saying that you did not give your daughters in order to keep them near you, you might seize them from me so as to detain the children and the property as well — as you yourself said afterward: <b>The daughters are my daughters, the sons are my sons, and the flocks are my flocks</b>. And all this you might have done with the help of the men of your land while I was still there — but you cannot accomplish it now that I have left your land."], :book :genesis, :voice :sforno, :lang :en, :chapter 31, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-22T16:32:48.321409691Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}